# Briq banner photography

Prefer **Prada-like campaign / lifestyle** frames over grey studio packshots.

## Do

- Shoes: on-model legs, walking, styled footwear (gallery `/2` `/3`), not lone shoe on white
- Clothing / luxury: natural on-model outfits; allow faces unless face-dominant headshot
- Bags: staged still-life or on-model carry; avoid flat `/1.jpg` packshots when better frames exist
- Watches: packshot dials remain OK
- Look-banner crops are **taller** (~2:1 desktop, more vertical on mobile) so subjects are not cropped
- Banners are fixed single images; replace one only when the user asks

## Do not

- Force packshot-first for shoes / bags / accessories / clothing
- Reject on-model frames for shoe/bag slots (use `lifestyle_product_source_ok`)
- Shrink look-banner `max-height` back to the old short panoramic strip
